-      <t indent="0" pn="section-7-3">Child:  &quot;The entity on record that has the delegation of the domain
-   from the Parent.&quot;  (Quoted from <xref target="RFC7344" section="1" format="default" sectionFormat="comma" derivedLink="https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7344#section-1" derivedContent="RFC7344"/>.1)</t>
