+to or the same as the owner name of the NS resource records.
+Glue records for sibling domains are allowed, but not
+necessary.  For example, a delegation for "child.example.com"
+in "example.com" zone may have "sibling" name server name
+"ns.another.example.com".</li>
+          </ul>
+          <t indent="0" pn="section-7-2.22.4">"Out-of-bailiwick" is the antonym of "in-bailiwick".  It is a
+modifier to describe a name server whose name is not subordinate
+to or the same as the zone origin.  Glue records for out-of-bailiwick name servers are useless.  The following table shows
+examples of delegation types.</t>
+          <table align="center" pn="table-1">
+            <thead>
+              <tr>
+                <th align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">Delegation</th>
+                <th align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">Parent</th>
+                <th align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">Name Server Name</th>
+                <th align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">Type</th>
+              </tr>
+            </thead>
+            <tbody>
+              <tr>
+                <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">com</td>
+                <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">.</td>
+                <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">a.gtld-servers.net</td>
+                <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">in-bailiwick / sibling domain</td>
+              </tr>
+              <tr>
+                <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">net</td>
+                <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">.</td>
+                <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">a.gtld-servers.net</td>
+                <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">in-bailiwick / in-domain</td>
+              </tr>
+              <tr>
+                <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">example.org</td>
+                <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">org</td>
+                <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">ns.example.org</td>
+                <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">in-bailiwick / in-domain</td>
+              </tr>
+              <tr>
+                <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">example.org</td>
+                <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">org</td>
+                <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">ns.ietf.org</td>
+                <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">in-bailiwick / sibling domain</td>
+              </tr>
+              <tr>
+                <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">example.org</td>
+                <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">org</td>
